    "body": "CMake `WITH_EXTERNAL_LIBMULTIPROCESS` and `BUILD_FUZZ_BINARY` options stopped working together recently due to #35118 commit 037ad77071419367fd679da71d5c39853d1e622e because an non-namespaced `Libmultiprocess::multiprocess` target name was referenced.\r\n\r\n Fix by specifying the full target name which is better for readability anyway.",
